{"ref": "YJ-T173:97", "unit_id": "YJ-T173", "source": "jbbs", "thread_title": "都市船計画スレ", "url": "https://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/movie/7039/173/", "post_no": 97, "author": "言理の妖精語りて曰く、", "date_raw": "2007/06/21(木) 23:53:29", "date_iso": "2007-06-21T23:53:29+09:00", "epoch": 1182437609.0, "file": "p0097-0098.md", "body": "都市船全長よりも高い塔をひとつ。\r\n\r\n意味は思いつきませんがとりあえずきっとインパクト大。"}
{"ref": "YJ-T173:98", "unit_id": "YJ-T173", "source": "jbbs", "thread_title": "都市船計画スレ", "url": "https://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/movie/7039/173/", "post_no": 98, "author": "言理の妖精語りて曰く、", "date_raw": "2007/06/23(土) 20:05:34", "date_iso": "2007-06-23T20:05:34+09:00", "epoch": 1182596734.0, "file": "p0097-0098.md", "body": "都市船って長さはkmか十km単位の大きさですよね？"}
{"ref": "YJ-T173:99", "unit_id": "YJ-T173", "source": "jbbs", "thread_title": "都市船計画スレ", "url": "https://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/movie/7039/173/", "post_no": 99, "author": "BELive", "date_raw": "2007/06/23(土) 22:01:33", "date_iso": "2007-06-23T22:01:33+09:00", "epoch": 1182603693.0, "file": "p0099-0100.md", "body": "全長:16.944km、全幅:11.116km、全高:6.448km　です。"}
{"ref": "YJ-T173:100", "unit_id": "YJ-T173", "source": "jbbs", "thread_title": "都市船計画スレ", "url": "https://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/movie/7039/173/", "post_no": 100, "author": "BELive", "date_raw": "2007/06/23(土) 22:05:45", "date_iso": "2007-06-23T22:05:45+09:00", "epoch": 1182603945.0, "file": "p0099-0100.md", "body": "あー……\r\n\r\n>>97\r\n\r\n中央管制タワーもあれで高さ2.8kmあるんですけども、それじゃダメですか。\r\n\r\nあまり高い建物は管制の邪魔になるので極力避けたいのですが……"}
{"ref": "YJ-T173:101", "unit_id": "YJ-T173", "source": "jbbs", "thread_title": "都市船計画スレ", "url": "https://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/movie/7039/173/", "post_no": 101, "author": "言理の妖精語りて曰く、", "date_raw": "2007/06/23(土) 22:44:09", "date_iso": "2007-06-23T22:44:09+09:00", "epoch": 1182606249.0, "file": "p0101-0104.md", "body": "逆に考えましょう。\r\n\r\n管制タワーを高くすれば万事オーケー。"}
